# LF everywhere, checked in and checked out.
#
# This is not style. reference/artifacts.md §6 makes `artifact_hash` a sha256
# over a file's bytes at the reviewed commit, so a line-ending change silently
# invalidates a gate signature. A repository that normalises per-platform
# cannot carry hash-bound approvals.
#
# tools/spec-kit-bundle/ already required this for the same reason, and
# tools/spec-kit-checker/check_specs.py enforces it on product repos.
#
# Set 2026-07-28 by ADR-0025 part 5, before anything in this repository pins a
# hash. Doing it later would be a migration.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.ico binary
